    "alternating_content_story": {
      "type": "alternating-content",
      "blocks": {
        "row_sourcing": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image_position": "image_first",
            "label": "Sourcing",
            "title": "Where Our Plants Begin Their Journey",
            "title_dom_type": "h2",
            "title_size": "h2",
            "body": "<p>Behind every Soilboy plant is a dedicated sourcing process that spans regions and climates. We work directly with trusted growers overseas and carefully select each specimen for form, health, and character. Once they arrive in our warehouse, every plant is acclimatised, nurtured, and prepared with the same design-led care you’ll experience in our studio.<\/p>",
            "desktop_image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Frame_8_e415aefe-bb96-4916-8046-9138541e8ccb.png",
            "mobile_image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Frame_8_1_f3a1a8ce-7962-417d-b908-dccd3956a23b.png",
            "caption_label": "OBJ 01.",
            "caption_text": "Soilboy Flat Pot Small, Speckled"
          }
        },
        "row_warehouse": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image_position": "text_first",
            "label": "Warehouse",
            "title": "From Farms Abroad to Our Warehouse Oasis",
            "title_dom_type": "h2",
            "title_size": "h2",
            "body": "<p>Our plants travel from specialised growers around the world to our temperature-controlled warehouse, where they are tended to with patience and precision. This is where we acclimatise, style, and prepare each plant—ensuring you receive greenery that’s healthy, resilient, and ready to thrive in your space.<\/p>",
            "desktop_image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Frame_8_2.png",
            "mobile_image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Frame_8_3.png",
            "caption_label": "OBJ 01.",
            "caption_text": "Soilboy Flat Pot Small, Speckled"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "row_sourcing",
        "row_warehouse"
      ],
      "name": "Alternating Content",
